 "_comment": "The part of the package that is written by hand: what each of the machines is called in Chimera, which of Mednafen's ports belongs to which player, the names of the controls where Mednafen's own would collide or carry signs a movie cannot hold, and the settings a project may set, with what a user reads about each. Everything else - which devices a port takes, every button and axis of each, a setting's type, default, limits and choices - is read from Mednafen's own tables (run-native --describe) by gen-config.py, which stops when something here names a thing Mednafen does not have.",
